  {
   "id": 1117323,
   "title": "Moving the Z-axis",
   "updated": "2026-07-23 07:30:43",
   "lines": [
    {
     "html": "Before you begin, move the heatbed to an accessible position.",
     "color": null,
     "icon": "note",
     "level": 0
    },
    {
     "html": "During this step, <strong>keep the printer door closed</strong> and do not reach inside.",
     "color": null,
     "icon": "caution",
     "level": 0
    },
    {
     "html": "In the printer menu, go to <em><strong>Control -&gt; Auto Home</strong></em>.",
     "color": "blue",
     "icon": null,
     "level": 0
    },
    {
     "html": "After Auto Home, move the heatbed down via <em><strong>Control -&gt; Move Axis -&gt; Move Z</strong></em> until the highlighted screws and the underside of the heatbed are accessible (minimum <strong>200 mm</strong>).",
     "color": "yellow",
     "icon": null,
     "level": 0
    },
    {
     "html": "This ensures both areas will be comfortably accessible during the procedure, as they will need to be handled later in the manual.",
     "color": null,
     "icon": "note",
     "level": 1
    }
   ],
